{"3292730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death In Your Dice", "steam_appid": 3292730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/9c13ea829b668dd48eaf8e53cf3b6746.poster.avif?t=1786772278\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/9c13ea829b668dd48eaf8e53cf3b6746.webm?t=1786772278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/9c13ea829b668dd48eaf8e53cf3b6746.mp4?t=1786772278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious figure draws you into the game. Price: death. Executioner: you. You have dice in your hand and the consequences of this game on your shoulders. Act, predict, observe, and above all... cheat? How long will you last before your conscience drives you mad? How long will you last before you throw away your values? Do you think you are capable of making sacrifices in the name of honor? The time of trial has come. Even if the die has been cast, let your decisions determine you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/2d746bc0d94a7f3c64c4cefb6fd5d2af.poster.avif?t=1786772278\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/2d746bc0d94a7f3c64c4cefb6fd5d2af.webm?t=1786772278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292730/extras/2d746bc0d94a7f3c64c4cefb6fd5d2af.mp4?t=1786772278\" type=\"video/mp4\